            "error": "",
            "examples": "Enumerate the logical shapes attached to a collision object:\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kr\">function</span> <span class=\"nf\">init</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">object</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_collision_object</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;#collisionobject&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kr\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">shape</span> <span class=\"kr\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">ipairs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">collision_object</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_shapes</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">object</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"kr\">do</span>\n        <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">index</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_index</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_shape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;shape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
