        {
            "brief": "Set shape geometry data.",
            "description": "The table uses the same format as <code>get_shape</code>. Its <code>type</code> must match the\nexisting shape because changing native shape type is not supported. Primitive\ndimensions must be finite and greater than zero. Hulls require at least four\nfinite vertices.",
            "error": "",
